{
  "uid": "sglang-runtime",
  "title": "SGLang Runtime \u2014 localRun0814_A",
  "description": "SGLang on Apple M3 Pro via the MLX Metal backend. Every metric name here was verified against a live /metrics scrape. Panels deliberately avoid sglang:kv_cache_memory_usage_gb and sglang:weight_memory_usage_gb, which read 0 under MLX.",
